{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q2118147","formula":"C₂₄H₃₂O₈","hill":"C24H32O8","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":24.0,"H":32.0,"O":8.0},"names":{"en":"Salvinorin B ethoxymethyl ether"},"descriptions":{"en":"Salvinorin B ethoxymethyl ether, also known as 2-O-ethoxymethylsalvinorin B (2-EMSB) or as symmetry, is a semi-synthetic analogue of the natural product salvinorin A, the psychoactive chemical in Salvia Divinorum, with a longer duration of action of around 3 hours (compared to less than 30 minutes for salvinorin A), and increased affinity and intrinsic activity at the κ-opioid receptor. Like the related compound herkinorin, 2-EMSB is made from salvinorin B, which is most conveniently made from salvinorin A by deacetylation, as while both salvinorin A and salvinorin B are found in the plant Salvia divinorum, salvinorin A is present in larger quantities."},"fame":3,"pubchemCid":24873526,"mass":448.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCOCO[C@H]1C[C@H]([C@@]2(CC[C@H]3C(=O)O[C@@H](C[C@@]3([C@H]2C1=O)C)C4=COC=C4)C)C(=O)OC","inchikey":"ICVTXAUKIHJDGV-WFOQEEKOSA-N","iupac":"methyl (2S,4aR,6aR,7R,9S,10aS,10bR)-9-(ethoxymethoxy)-2-(furan-3-yl)-6a,10b-dimethyl-4,10-dioxo-2,4a,5,6,7,8,9,10a-octahydro-1H-benzo[f]isochromene-7-carboxylate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"24873526","atoms":64,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":3.996,"y":1.272,"z":0.042,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.823,"y":-2.203,"z":1.158,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.445,"y":-1.275,"z":1.965,"el":"O"},{"x":3.555,"y":3.478,"z":-0.039,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.677,"y":1.697,"z":-1.391,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.507,"y":3.37,"z":-0.31,"el":"O"},{"x":5.709,"y":-2.894,"z":-0.694,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.707,"y":-4.195,"z":-0.169,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.291,"y":1.678,"z":0.232,"el":"C"},{"x":1.207,"y":0.811,"z":0.664,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.276,"y":0.48,"z":0.274,